<title>SWEDEN: Getinge in alliance with Johnson &amp; Johnson unit.</title>
<headline>Getinge in alliance with Johnson &amp; Johnson unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Getinge Industrier AB said on Wednesday that it was building a strategic alliance with Advanced Sterilisation Products (ASP), a unit of Johnson &amp; Johnson Medical Inc.</p>
<p>The alliance covers North and South America.</p>
<p>&quot;Under the terms of the alliance, Getinge and ASP will work jointly to increase market acceptance and penetration of each company's core technologies,&quot; Getinge said in a statement.</p>
</text>
